       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SUMARRAY.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 ARR.
           05 ARR-ITEM PIC 9(3) OCCURS 5 TIMES.
       01 I PIC 9(2).
       01 TOTAL PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 1 TO ARR-ITEM(1)
           MOVE 2 TO ARR-ITEM(2)
           MOVE 3 TO ARR-ITEM(3)
           MOVE 4 TO ARR-ITEM(4)
           MOVE 5 TO ARR-ITEM(5)
           PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 5
               ADD ARR-ITEM(I) TO TOTAL
           END-PERFORM
           DISPLAY "TOTAL: " TOTAL
           STOP RUN.
